{"id":"mahabharata-5-169","work":"mahabharata","part":5,"partName":"उद्योगपर्व","partNameEn":"Udyoga Parva","unit":169,"title":"एकोनसप्तत्यधिकशततमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 169 · Bhishma's limits","summary":{"en":"Bhishma completes the list with Ghatotkacha and others, and says he will fight them all, but will not kill the Pandavas, nor fight Shikhandin; every other king who faces him, he will slay.","kn":"ಘಟೋತ್ಕಚ ಮೊದಲಾದವರೊಂದಿಗೆ ಪಟ್ಟಿ ಮುಗಿಸಿ, ಎಲ್ಲರೊಂದಿಗೂ ಹೋರಾಡುವೆ ಆದರೆ ಪಾಂಡವರನ್ನು ಕೊಲ್ಲೆನು, ಶಿಖಂಡಿಯೊಂದಿಗೆ ಹೋರಾಡೆನು, ತನ್ನನ್ನು ಎದುರಿಸುವ ಇತರ ಎಲ್ಲ ರಾಜರನ್ನೂ ಕೊಲ್ಲುವೆ ಎಂದು ಭೀಷ್ಮನು ಹೇಳುತ್ತಾನೆ.","hi":"भीष्म घटोत्कच और अन्यों के साथ सूची पूरी करते हैं और कहते हैं कि वे सबसे लड़ेंगे, पर पाण्डवों को नहीं मारेंगे, न शिखण्डी से लड़ेंगे; उनका सामना करने वाले अन्य सब राजाओं को वे मार डालेंगे।","te":"ఘటోత్కచుడు మొదలైనవారితో జాబితా ముగించి, అందరితో పోరాడతానని, కానీ పాండవులను చంపనని, శిఖండితో పోరాడనని, తనను ఎదుర్కొనే ఇతర రాజులందరినీ సంహరిస్తానని భీష్ముడు అంటాడు.","ta":"கடோத்கசன் முதலியோருடன் பட்டியலை முடித்து, அனைவருடனும் போரிடுவேன் ஆனால் பாண்டவர்களைக் கொல்ல மாட்டேன், ஶிகண்டியுடன் போரிட மாட்டேன், என்னை எதிர்க்கும் மற்ற எல்லா மன்னர்களையும் கொல்வேன் என்று பீஷ்மர் சொல்கிறார்.","ml":"ഘടോൽക്കചനെയും മറ്റുള്ളവരെയും ചേർത്ത് ഭീഷ്മർ പട്ടിക പൂർത്തിയാക്കുന്നു; അവരെയെല്ലാം താൻ നേരിടുമെന്ന് പറയുന്നു. പാണ്ഡവരെ കൊല്ലില്ലെന്നും, ശിഖണ്ഡിയോട് പൊരുതില്ലെന്നും അദ്ദേഹം പറയുന്നു; തന്നെ നേരിടുന്ന മറ്റെല്ലാ രാജാക്കന്മാരെയും താൻ വധിക്കുമെന്ന് പ്രഖ്യാപിക്കുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 5.169; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Tue Jan 23 2024","sections":[{"title":"रथातिरथसंख्यापर्व","titleEn":"Rathatirathasankhya Parva (Counting the warriors)","verses":[{"text":"भीष्म उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Bhishma said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"रोचमानो महाराज पाण्डवानां महारथः ।\nयोत्स्यतेऽमरवत्संख्ये परसैन्येषु भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Rochamana, great king, a great chariot-warrior of the Pandavas, will fight in battle like an immortal against the enemy armies, Bharata."}},{"n":2,"text":"पुरुजित्कुन्तिभोजश्च महेष्वासो महाबलः ।\nमातुलो भीमसेनस्य स च मेऽतिरथो मतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Purujit Kuntibhoja, a great archer of great strength, Bhimasena's maternal uncle, I count as an atiratha."}},{"n":3,"text":"एष वीरो महेष्वासः कृती च निपुणश्च ह ।\nचित्रयोधी च शक्तश्च मतो मे रथपुंगवः ॥","meaning":{"en":"This hero, great archer, skilled and expert, a varied fighter and able, is counted by me a bull among chariot-warriors."}},{"n":4,"text":"स योत्स्यति हि विक्रम्य मघवानिव दानवैः ।\nयोधाश्चास्य परिख्याताः सर्वे युद्धविशारदाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"He will fight bravely like Maghavan against the danavas, and all his famed warriors are expert in battle."}},{"n":5,"text":"भागिनेयकृते वीरः स करिष्यति संगरे ।\nसुमहत्कर्म पाण्डूनां स्थितः प्रियहिते नृपः ॥","meaning":{"en":"For his nephews' sake that hero will do a very great deed in the battle, that king who stands for the Pandavas' welfare."}},{"n":6,"text":"भैमसेनिर्महाराज हैडिम्बो राक्षसेश्वरः ।\nमतो मे बहुमायावी रथयूथपयूथपः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bhimasena's son, Hidimba's son, king of rakshasas, great king, is counted by me as a great master of illusions and leader of the leaders of chariot-fighters."}},{"n":7,"text":"योत्स्यते समरे तात मायाभिः समरप्रियः ।\nये चास्य राक्षसाः शूराः सचिवा वशवर्तिनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"He will fight in battle, dear one, with illusions, delighting in war, with his brave rakshasa ministers who obey him."}},{"n":8,"text":"एते चान्ये च बहवो नानाजनपदेश्वराः ।\nसमेताः पाण्डवस्यार्थे वासुदेवपुरोगमाः ॥","meaning":{"en":"These and many other lords of various lands have gathered for the Pandava, with Vasudeva at their head."}},{"n":9,"text":"एते प्राधान्यतो राजन्पाण्डवस्य महात्मनः ।\nरथाश्चातिरथाश्चैव ये चाप्यर्धरथा मताः ॥","meaning":{"en":"These, king, are the chief chariot-warriors, atirathas and half chariot-warriors counted on the side of the great-souled Pandava."}},{"n":10,"text":"नेष्यन्ति समरे सेनां भीमां यौधिष्ठिरीं नृप ।\nमहेन्द्रेणेव वीरेण पाल्यमानां किरीटिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"They will lead Yudhishthira's terrible army in battle, guarded by the hero Arjuna as if by Mahendra."}},{"n":11,"text":"तैरहं समरे वीर त्वामायद्भिर्जयैषिभिः ।\nयोत्स्यामि जयमाकाङ्क्षन्नथ वा निधनं रणे ॥","meaning":{"en":"With them, hero, as they come for victory against you, I will fight, desiring victory or death in battle."}},{"n":12,"text":"पार्थं च वासुदेवं च चक्रगाण्डीवधारिणौ ।\nसंध्यागताविवार्केन्दू समेष्ये पुरुषोत्तमौ ॥","meaning":{"en":"I will meet Partha and Vasudeva, bearers of discus and Gandiva, the best of men, like the sun and moon at twilight."}},{"n":13,"text":"ये चैव ते रथोदाराः पाण्डुपुत्रस्य सैनिकाः ।\nसहसैन्यानहं तांश्च प्रतीयां रणमूर्धनि ॥","meaning":{"en":"And those noble chariot-warriors who are soldiers of the Pandava, I will face with their armies at the head of the battle."}},{"n":14,"text":"एते रथाश्चातिरथाश्च तुभ्यं\nयथाप्रधानं नृप कीर्तिता मया ।\nतथा राजन्नर्धरथाश्च केचि-\nत्तथैव तेषामपि कौरवेन्द्र ॥","meaning":{"en":"These chariot-warriors and atirathas, king, I have named to you according to rank; and likewise, Kaurava king, some half chariot-warriors of theirs too."}},{"n":15,"text":"अर्जुनं वासुदेवं च ये चान्ये तत्र पार्थिवाः ।\nसर्वानावारयिष्यामि यावद्द्रक्ष्यामि भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Arjuna, Vasudeva, and whatever other kings are there, I will hold them all off as long as I see them, Bharata."}},{"n":16,"text":"पाञ्चाल्यं तु महाबाहो नाहं हन्यां शिखण्डिनम् ।\nउद्यतेषुमभिप्रेक्ष्य प्रतियुध्यन्तमाहवे ॥","meaning":{"en":"But, mighty-armed, I will not kill Shikhandin of Panchala, even seeing him ready to shoot, fighting me in battle."}},{"n":17,"text":"लोकस्तद्वेद यदहं पितुः प्रियचिकीर्षया ।\nप्राप्तं राज्यं परित्यज्य ब्रह्मचर्ये धृतव्रतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"The world knows that, to please my father, I gave up the kingdom that came to me and took a vow of celibacy."}},{"n":18,"text":"चित्राङ्गदं कौरवाणामहं राज्येऽभ्यषेचयम् ।\nविचित्रवीर्यं च शिशुं यौवराज्येऽभ्यषेचयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"I consecrated Chitrangada as king of the Kauravas, and the child Vichitravirya as heir apparent."}},{"n":19,"text":"देवव्रतत्वं विख्याप्य पृथिव्यां सर्वराजसु ।\nनैव हन्यां स्त्रियं जातु न स्त्रीपूर्वं कथंचन ॥","meaning":{"en":"Having proclaimed myself Devavrata to all kings on earth, I will never kill a woman or anyone who was formerly a woman."}},{"n":20,"text":"स हि स्त्रीपूर्वको राजञ्शिखण्डी यदि ते श्रुतः ।\nकन्या भूत्वा पुमाञ्जातो न योत्स्ये तेन भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"If you have heard, king, Shikhandin was formerly a woman; born a girl, he became a man; I will not fight him, Bharata."}},{"n":21,"text":"सर्वांस्त्वन्यान्हनिष्यामि पार्थिवान्भरतर्षभ ।\nयान्समेष्यामि समरे न तु कुन्तीसुतान्नृप ॥","meaning":{"en":"I will kill all other kings, best of Bharatas, whom I meet in battle, but not the sons of Kunti, king."}}]}]}